WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,170
Tang Cheng

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:08,850
Are you back? Who is coming?

3
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:10,750
From Shen Chenglai

4
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,820
Said to be a great leader

5
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,900
Bai Jingwei invited Mr. Li

6
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,940
The old chief is in the house

7
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,480
The mountainous area of Nagen has been dispatched to help.

8
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:26,030
But if you want to really save your life

9
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,230
It depends on you

10
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:31,950
Just came back from the mountains

11
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:36,720
Got into some trouble, Mr. Li

12
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:37,960
Never mind the trouble for now

13
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,720
Mrs. Chen can only help the old chief.

14
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,680
Put it off any longer
